{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1140747-need-help-making-a-ghost","id":1140747,"title":"Need help making a ghost","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-16T02:17:33-07:00","id":1140747,"title":"Need help making a ghost","content":"I'm reading through the rules for making ghosts in the CoD book and it's making my head spin. I want to make a child ghost that haunts a building for an adventure I'm creating. I'm assuming I'd make the building his Anchor, correct? If I want the ghost to be able to animate objects within the house, and create hallucinations (terrifying visions similar to the Nightmare Discipline from Vampire, as well as flashbacks to when the child was alive) would that be handled by a high level of Influence, or would that be something else? Also, can a ghost force other ghosts to remain trapped within a building? The idea is to make a ghost that &quot;plays&quot; with people until he kills them, then he traps their ghosts to keep them as eternal &quot;friends&quot;. is there a way to do this mechanically, or is it just Storyteller fiat?<br /> <br /> I really wish the CoD book had example builds of ghosts like it does with horrors. Are there any example builds of ghosts in other books I can take a look at just to see what fully built ghosts look like?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13542-shadowdragon","name":"Shadowdragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-16T04:02:50-07:00","id":1140765,"title":"","content":"For bringing objects to life and inflicting scary visions, you may use the Telekinesis and Hallucination Numina. Whether your ghost can keep others trapped in the building probably depends on Rank. If he is just a &quot;looping record&quot; ghost, he is Rank 1, but if he is self aware, he is Rank 2. Going Rank 3+ requires going to the Underworld, which usually requires the destruction of the Anchors in the first place.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\"><b>This thread</b></a> has some sample ghosts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-16T05:24:22-07:00","id":1140776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1140747-need-help-making-a-ghost?p=1140765#post1140765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For bringing objects to life and inflicting scary visions, you may use the Telekinesis and Hallucination Numina. Whether your ghost can keep others trapped in the building probably depends on Rank. If he is just a &quot;looping record&quot; ghost, he is Rank 1, but if he is self aware, he is Rank 2. Going Rank 3+ requires going to the Underworld, which usually requires the destruction of the Anchors in the first place.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\"><b>This thread</b></a> has some sample ghosts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Could the Maze (Dread Power, but do it as a Numina) enable keeping Ghosts contained? Or the Entrap or No Exit Numina?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-16T15:23:51-07:00","id":1140910,"title":"","content":"Place an entrance to the Underworld within the building, it holds the ghosts there until they get up the courage to enter, something the original ghost strives to prevent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}